## Getting Started

To begin using the Unified Quantum Documentation System, start with the interactive shell:

```bash
cd /mnt/d/cqil/documentation
./uqds.sh
```

For project creation, use the Universal Builder:

```bash
cd /mnt/d/cqil/documentation
./builder.sh create <project_name> <template>
```

For navigation assistance, use the Quantum Navigator:

```bash
cd /mnt/d/cqil/documentation
./uqds.sh
UQDS> navigate <your intention here>
```

